title A law earns the first nested composition -- the shelf-offset law speaks and-of-ors in Glow
prompt Keaton re-armed Mind and said kg Sound; the survey the growth law demands found a real law wanting the nested door.
think The survey walked my lane's Rye for compound conditions and found pond/apps/preset_shelf.rye line 104: an offset at or past the count refuses BadOffset unless both stand at zero. In seated operators that is an and over two ors -- at-or-past is gth or eq, and not-both-zero is either face above zero -- needing no new operator, exactly the nested-composition door.
think The growth is bounded to what the law wants: a new body kind cond_and_of_ors in glow/rune_shop_gate.rye whose two operands are each an or-pair of comparisons, depth exactly two by construction, no recursion. Four spec field arrays carry the comparison seats; a parse_nested_cmp function walks each (gth-or-eq, header-face left side, literal or header-face right side); the road forks where the first operand's own head reads or, and only and composes ors -- an or-of-ors refuses by name, keeping the grammar a closed table.
think The lower gained a shared nested_cmp_str renderer and three arms: the demo expect walking the four seats, the welcome-road selftest emit, and the argv-road emit through the existing two-sample speaking main under gate name bartis_and_of_ors. The compiler named every switch owing an arm; the header-validation whitelist was the last silent refuser, found by tracer prints planted and removed in the same lap.
think Two of my own faults caught by the tree's guards mid-lap: a compound assert the TAME check bans (split), and authored usize in the new functions that red the shop witness's width leg (indices molted to u32 with the cast at the array seam). The witness escape layers ate an inline printf plant, so the or-of-ors refusal now reads a tracked fixture.
think Proven on metal: five answers on gate-pond-preset-offset-u32 mirror the Rye law exactly (0,0 lawful; 0,5 lawful; 5,5 and 7,5 and 1,0 refuse); the ?&/?| rune twin answers as the word twin; the or-of-ors fixture refuses MalformedBody; the shop's own ladder runs GREEN end to end; TAME bans clean.
obs The foundation's test held its shape: name the law, point at the Rye, point at the desk. The lap began with a grep, not a feature idea -- and the one door still named, deeper nesting, stays closed the same way this one used to be.
